: OpenAI chat-completions SSE stream (POST /v1/chat/completions with
: stream_options.include_usage). A two-call PARALLEL BATCH, both calls naming
: the SAME tool: each opens on its own tool_calls index carrying its own
: call_ id, and the argument fragments arrive afterwards interleaved between
: the two indices.
:
: Same-tool is the case the whole tool-call-id change exists for. Correlating
: a result back to its call by tool name has two answers here and picks one,
: which feeds the model file a's contents as the answer to the read of b. Only
: call_aaa and call_bbb tell the two apart, and the ids in this fixture are
: the only place a test can get them without inventing them.
:
: The usage block also carries a cache hit (1,920 of 2,048 prompt tokens
: served from the prefix cache); unlike Anthropic's, this one is a subset of
: prompt_tokens and is never added to it.
:
: Lines starting with a colon are SSE comments. Both adapters skip every line
: that does not begin with "data" plus a colon, so this header travels with
: the bytes without changing what is parsed.
:
: This file is also compiled into the adapter's own tests as
: llm::test_support::PARALLEL_TOOL_BATCH_SSE, so the in-process decoder tests
: and the over-a-socket ones read the same bytes. See the header of
: tests/recorded_provider.rs for how to re-record it from a live stream once
: the adapter's dump hook exists.

data: {"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_aaa","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":""}}]}}]}

data: {"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"index":1,"id":"call_bbb","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":""}}]}}]}

data: {"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"index":0,"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"a\"}"}}]}}]}

data: {"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"index":1,"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"b\"}"}}]},"finish_reason":"tool_calls"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2048,"completion_tokens":31,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1920}}}

data: [DONE]
